- [react-codemod](https://github.com/reactjs/react-codemod) - React codemod 
scripts to update React APIs.
- [js-codemod](https://github.com/cpojer/js-codemod/) - Codemod scripts to 
transform code to next generation JS.
- [js-transforms](https://github.com/jhgg/js-transforms) - Some documented 
codemod experiments to help you learn.
