  1. **Brace `dots`/`comma` flags**: JS stores `dots`/`comma` as fields on the 
brace record pushed to `braces[]`; the Rust port infers them from token/stack 
state, so `{1..3}` ranges never expand via `expandRange`. Evidence: 
